~ start

match get_choice_count("jumped_in_leaves")
	when 0
		There's a pile of leaves here.

		- Jump in it
			$> increment_choice("jumped_in_leaves")
			$> hide_node("Sprite2D")
			$> show_node("EvilLeaves")
			$> make_walkable()
			PLUM: Whee!! (happy)
			=> END

		- Leave it alone
			=> END

	else
		Look at what you've done.
		=> END